  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell augments your diplomacies. While under the effects of spell, you roll two dice each time you make a Diplomacy check to change a creature’s attitude, taking the highest roll. If this results in a roll low enough to reduce the creature’s attitude by a step, that creature gets some clue that you are manipulating it with a spell. Alternatively you can cast this spell before making a Diplomacy check to gather information, gaining a +5 competence bonus on the check.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell augments your diplomacies. while under the effects of spell, you roll two dice each time you make a diplomacy check to change a creature’s attitude, taking the highest roll. if this results in a roll low enough to reduce the creature’s attitude by a step, that creature gets some clue that you are manipulating it with a spell. alternatively you can cast this spell before making a diplomacy check to gather information, gaining a +5 competence bonus on the check.\"",
